  "result": "I made the three fixes in four files; I did not run the test suite.\n\n- **Non-subscribers getting digests:** `listDigestSubscribers` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts` now only selects users with a row where `digestOnly` is true. Before, any preference row qualified.\n- **Oldest updates kept:** `listUnreadSince` in `src/server/repositories/notification-repository.ts` now orders newest first (`createdAt` desc, then `id` desc). `buildDigest` slices to the cap after that, so the newest updates are kept and the email's headline is the newest.\n- **Archived workspaces sending digests:** `runDigestEmailJob` in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts` now skips orgs where `isArchived(org)` is true, using the existing helper from `@/lib/soft-delete`.",
